          %h2#lagrangian_densities Lagrangian densities
          %h3#ChernSimonsElements Cosmo-cocycle equations
          %p We discuss how actional functionals for supergravity theories are special cases of this.
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/first-order+formulation+of+gravity"} first-order formulation of gravity
            where the field of
