          %p
            We discuss a system of equations that characterizes a necessary condition on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+elements"} Chern-Simons elements
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Weil+algebra"} Weil algebra
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
